      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA superb opportunity to acquire a versatile property in a prominent and convenient location on Dublin Street, Monasterevin. The property comprises three separate units, offering excellent flexibility for a variety of uses, including office or residential accommodation\n\nThe property is presented in turn-key condition throughout, requiring little or no immediate refurbishment and allowing a purchaser to make use of the accommodation from day one.\nIdeally positioned within the heart of Monasterevin town, the property benefits from excellent public transport links and is within easy reach of the M7 motorway.\n\nWhether considered as an part owner-occupier opportunity, investment property or mixed-use development, this property offers excellent potential in a well connected and established location.\n\nTo place an offer on this property, register for your mySherryFitz account at www.SherryFitz.ie"
      },
